---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ENGINEERING_PILOT, ANALYTICS_EVENTS } from '../../../data/site.js';
---
<Layout title={`Capability brief | ${ENGINEERING_PILOT.name}`} description={ENGINEERING_PILOT.description} hideFooterNewsletter={true}>
<article class="brief wrap">
<header><div class="identity"><strong>COLLIN WILKINS</strong><span>AI-assisted delivery systems for engineering teams</span><a href="/">collinwilkins.com</a></div><h1>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.lead}</h1><p class="lead">I install a repository-native delivery path for small engineering teams already using AI coding tools. The pilot connects structured work intake, repository context, a bounded coding agent, existing quality checks, human review, and visible model usage without replacing the issue tracker or deployment pipeline.</p><div class="actions"><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.bookingPageOpen} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallLabel}</a><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.pilotCtaClick} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeLabel}</a><a class="pdf" href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.capabilityBriefPdfHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.capabilityBriefDownload} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-header">Download PDF</a></div></header>
<div class="grid"><section><h2>The AI-Assisted Delivery Pilot</h2><p class="contract"><strong>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.priceLabel}</strong> · {ENGINEERING_PILOT.deliveryWindow} · {ENGINEERING_PILOT.deliveryMode}</p><p>{ENGINEERING_PILOT.scope} The team owns the installed assets after handoff.</p><h3>The pilot includes</h3><ul><li>Structured issue intake; Jira or Linear as optional adapters</li><li>Repository-specific <code>AGENTS.md</code> and one coding-agent adapter</li><li>Protected paths, existing quality checks, and optional read-only AI review</li><li>Version-controlled model config and defensible usage visibility</li><li>Five model-change smoke cases, handoff guide, and working session</li></ul><h3>The operating path</h3><p class="path">Qualified issue → human marks ready → agent branch and draft PR → CI and protected-path checks → optional read-only review → human approval and normal deployment.</p><p>The agent does not approve its own work, merge, deploy, access production credentials, or silently widen the issue.</p></section>
<section><h2>Best fit</h2><ul><li>Owner-led software companies, consultancies, or product teams with roughly 5–25 engineers</li><li>Teams using Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot, or another coding agent</li><li>Variable output quality, growing review churn, or missing shared repository rules</li><li>A technical owner ready to approve and review one real pilot issue</li></ul><h2>Not a fit</h2><ul><li>Enterprise-wide transformation, replacement CI/CD, autonomous production deployment, or open-ended embedded support</li><li>Investment management, wealth advisory, retirement solutions, ESG data, credit ratings, or financial-services compliance software</li></ul><h2>Selected enterprise experience</h2><p class="qualifier">Outcomes from full-time engineering roles, not consulting clients.</p><ul><li>Broader AI-adoption and delivery-hardening initiative associated with 42% fewer defects and approximately 20% shorter cycle time</li><li>Approximately 90% less processing volume/time and 35% better throughput/latency</li><li>600K+ events/day; 450K+ vehicles; work associated with approximately $5M annual savings</li><li>Secure AWS delivery onboarding 23+ enterprise recordkeepers</li></ul></section></div>
<footer class="close"><div><h2>Start with one repository and one real issue.</h2><p>Repository access stays minimal. Production credentials are not accepted. Client source and installed assets stay private. Calls are recorded for notes by default; clients can opt out before the session.</p></div><div class="actions"><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.bookingPageOpen} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-close">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.fitCallLabel}</a><a href={ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeHref} data-analytics-event={ANALYTICS_EVENTS.pilotCtaClick} data-analytics-location="capability-brief-close">{ENGINEERING_PILOT.intakeLabel}</a></div></footer>
</article>
</Layout>
<script define:vars={{ capabilityBriefView: ANALYTICS_EVENTS.capabilityBriefView }}>if(window.plausible)window.plausible(capabilityBriefView,{props:{location:'capability-brief-page'}});</script>
<style>
.brief{max-width:1000px;padding-top:70px;padding-bottom:70px}.identity{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;letter-spacing:.04em}.identity span{color:var(--ink-soft)}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,64px);line-height:1;margin:20px 0 14px}.lead{font-size:19px;line-height:1.45}.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;margin-top:15px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px;margin-top:32px;padding-top:25px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 8px}h3{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:16px 0 6px}p,li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:6px 0}.contract,.path,.qualifier{font-size:13px}.qualifier{font-style:italic}.close{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:24px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin-top:25px;padding-top:20px}.close h2{font-size:28px}.pdf{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:700px){.grid,.close{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pdf{margin-left:0}}@media print{@page{size:Letter;margin:.35in}:global(body){background:#fff!important;color:#000!important}.brief{padding:0;max-width:none}.brief :global(a){color:#000!important;text-decoration:underline}.brief :global(p),.brief :global(li){font-size:9pt;line-height:1.05;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt}.brief :global(h1){font-size:20pt;line-height:.95;margin:4pt 0 3pt}.brief :global(h2){font-size:12pt;line-height:1;margin:2pt 0}.brief :global(h3),.brief :global(.identity),.brief :global(.actions),.brief :global(.contract),.brief :global(.path),.brief :global(.qualifier){font-size:9pt;line-height:1.05}.brief :global(h3){margin:4pt 0 1pt}.brief :global(ul){margin:1pt 0;padding-left:12pt}.grid{gap:10pt;margin-top:5pt;padding-top:4pt}.actions{margin-top:4pt}.close{gap:8pt;margin-top:4pt;padding-top:4pt}.close h2{font-size:13pt}:global(nav),:global(body > footer),.pdf{display:none!important}}
</style>
